  "rationale": "Freeze the genuine clean-worktree RED contract for CTX-010-RED before any context-handoff source, configuration, hook, skill, rule, sync, generated, or documentation mutation. The black-box suite binds stdlib CLI operations, bounded signal precedence and thresholds, canonical HandoffSnapshotV1 security and atomicity, no-loss lane merging, authority and operator-only safety, native Codex/Claude/AGY mappings, trusted-project denial, unchanged existing registrations, and acceptance-focused sync/skill behavior. Relevant existing negative control `python3 -m pytest -q tests/test_claude_agy_parity.py::test_lifecycle_hooks_executable` exited 0 with `1 passed`, proving the pre-existing lifecycle hook executability control remains green. DispatchDecision v1 remains the supplied READY_TO_VALIDATE static routing intent only and is not provider proof."
